= The Court Rules on Abortion

[? if court_lean >= 1 : The Supreme Court has overturned Roe v. Wade, ending the constitutional right to abortion and sending the issue to the states. ?][? if court_lean < 1 : The Supreme Court has upheld abortion rights in a major ruling that nevertheless leaves much unsettled. ?]

- @abortion_codify: Make it a central issue
- @abortion_moderate: Frame it around freedom and privacy

@abortion_codify
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.court_lean >= 1) { Q.dem_enthusiasm = Math.min(10, Q.dem_enthusiasm + 1.5); Q.suburban_dem += 4 * (1 - Q.dissent); Q.young_dem += 3 * (1 - Q.dissent); Q.educated_dem += 2 * (1 - Q.dissent); Q.gop_enthusiasm = Math.min(10, Q.gop_enthusiasm + 0.5); }
else { Q.suburban_dem += 1 * (1 - Q.dissent); Q.polarization += 0.5; }
Q.progressive_dissent -= 3;
!}

Abortion rights ballot measures win in state after state.

@abortion_moderate
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.court_lean >= 1) { Q.dem_enthusiasm = Math.min(10, Q.dem_enthusiasm + 1); Q.suburban_dem += 3 * (1 - Q.dissent); Q.rural_dem += 1 * (1 - Q.dissent); }
Q.moderate_strength += 1; Q.progressive_dissent += 1;
!}

A messaging approach that appeals beyond our base.
